  "notes": "{頭痛|ずつう} refers to headaches, both literal and figurative.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {頭痛|ずつう}がする (to have a headache)\n- {頭痛|ずつう}がひどい (to have a terrible headache)\n- {頭痛|ずつう}{薬|やく} (headache medicine)\n- {頭痛|ずつう}の{種|たね} (source of headaches, cause for worry)\n- {偏|へん}{頭痛|ずつう} (migraine)\n\nSIMILAR EXPRESSIONS:\n- {頭|あたま}が{痛|いた}い: my head hurts (describes the sensation)\n- {頭痛|ずつう}がする: to have a headache (describes the condition)\n\nOTHER BODY PAIN VOCABULARY:\n- {腹痛|ふくつう} (stomachache)\n- {歯痛|しつう} (toothache)\n- {腰痛|ようつう} (back pain)",
